    "text": "procedure Show_Name_In_Expression is\n   type Mode is (Off, A, B, C, D);\n\n   M1 : Mode;\nbegin\n   M1 := A;\n\n   case M1 is\n     when Off | D   =>\n       null;\n     when A | B | C =>\n       M1 := D;\n   end case;\n\nend Show_Name_In_Expression;\n",
